00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:31.080
You interrupted me.

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:33.490
Just listen. This is by the way necessary.

00:06:37.190 --> 00:06:40.160
So what is the expert's opinion?

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:45.070
Changes in the body are side effects of a vegetative state.

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:47.400
So is this normal?

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:52.710
Nothing unusual.

00:06:54.210 --> 00:06:57.480
Quite comforting actually.

00:06:57.910 --> 00:07:01.750
From your words, the anxiety began to dissipate.

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:06.220
One who heals without acupuncture -

00:07:06.520 --> 00:07:08.250
