00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:10.190
It turned out that

00:07:10.920 --> 00:07:14.130
The royal physician is an expert in psychology.

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:19.170
So when my mixed two-faced state

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:20.530
will he let me go?

00:07:20.770 --> 00:07:23.270
All problems are related to your heart.

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:26.670
Once you accept this, the worries will go away.

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:29.810
You can start living again without worries.

00:07:29.810 --> 00:07:33.580
Should I accept myself as I am?

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:40.090
Reasonable. The only constant thing about me is my contradiction.

00:07:41.220 --> 00:07:42.260
By the way.

00:07:42.990 --> 00:07:45.560
The beauty cover herbs were great.

00:07:47.290 --> 00:07:48.530
Use them

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:50.730
