00:17:04.280 --> 00:17:06.290
Modest, but not stingy.

00:17:06.850 --> 00:17:09.620
Sophisticated, but not pretentious.

00:17:09.990 --> 00:17:11.520
This is the kind of feast I want.

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:20.830
I'll do the best I can in the next 2 weeks.

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:25.670
I hope we can work together.

00:17:32.140 --> 00:17:33.180
Your Majesty.

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:40.390
Is it so easy to make a man cry?

00:17:48.430 --> 00:17:50.760
I can't even believe it

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:53.070
