00:17:58.370 --> 00:18:02.340
Enemy of Royal Concubine Cho
not the Kim clan, but the queen.

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:06.480
Therefore, she was unable to see the big picture.

00:18:15.390 --> 00:18:19.190
