00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:06.610
He wants to reveal us during the Cart Day feast.

00:19:07.010 --> 00:19:08.910
Maybe the weapon is in his hands,

00:19:09.810 --> 00:19:12.880
but we must weaken it so that he does not take advantage of it.

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:15.750
Kim Mungeun thinks

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:19.550
