00:19:19.550 --> 00:19:22.150
But he cannot ask the king if he stole the book.

00:19:22.520 --> 00:19:23.760
It must be hard for him.

00:19:24.590 --> 00:19:27.360
Have we already found out who was hiding behind the mask?

00:19:27.360 --> 00:19:28.830
In the Detective Department

00:19:28.830 --> 00:19:30.700
