00:19:38.300 --> 00:19:40.840
Have you studied the position of other genera?

00:19:51.880 --> 00:19:53.320
The law of five seconds.

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:56.590
Five seconds are enough to fall in love.

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:01.590
Your Majesty, everyone is here.

00:20:01.590 --> 00:20:03.130
