-Yes.

00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:09.500
Nice to meet you.

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:12.040
Nice to meet you.

00:20:12.710 --> 00:20:17.080
Nice to meet you.

00:20:17.810 --> 00:20:19.110
Let's see.

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:21.480
A spark jumped between me and...

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:30.860
I liked this one too.

00:20:36.660 --> 00:20:41.600
Mrs. Yun, you are so lovely, maybe you can tell us more about yourself?

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:47.710
There is a beautiful mountain in my hometown.

00:20:48.170 --> 00:20:50.010
It's called Mount Kamaksan.

00:20:50.210 --> 00:20:52.380
-Camaxan?
-Yes, queen.

00:20:54.510 --> 00:20:56.120
Simply amazing.

00:20:56.120 --> 00:20:57.220
-Amazing?
-Amazing?

00:20:59.590 --> 00:21:00.650
-Your Majesty.
-Yes?

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:03.590
There is a big palace in my city.

00:21:03.590 --> 00:21:05.760
It was built by King Jeongjo.

00:21:05.760 --> 00:21:08.290
The only thing you can boast about is Hwaseong Palace?

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:12.130
Just talk about him.

00:21:12.630 --> 00:21:15.070
One more thing you can brag about

00:21:15.070 --> 00:21:17.900
if you become a concubine, Mrs. Hong.

00:21:19.170 --> 00:21:21.070
Queen, thank you!

00:21:23.980 --> 00:21:27.180
In my hometown there are entire fields of peach trees.

00:21:27.180 --> 00:21:29.380
During the flowering period

00:21:30.120 --> 00:21:31.750
