00:21:46.730 --> 00:21:48.630
My peach.

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:52.400
If you win these three clans to your side,

00:21:53.810 --> 00:21:57.780
then there will be a dragon and two phoenixes on your side.

00:21:59.180 --> 00:22:01.210
And then you will be able to conquer the white tiger.

00:22:08.290 --> 00:22:10.490
While Hwaseong Palace guards the gates,

00:22:11.620 --> 00:22:13.860
the landscapes of Mount Kamaxan delight my eyes,

00:22:14.560 --> 00:22:19.230
and the sweet scent of peach fills my chambers.

00:22:37.120 --> 00:22:39.990
Phapyeong clan Yun. Namyan clan Hon.

00:22:40.550 --> 00:22:41.790
Yohyn clan Min.

00:22:42.190 --> 00:22:44.060
Excellent balance of power.

00:22:46.830 --> 00:22:50.060
Innocent, sexy and sweet.

00:22:50.500 --> 00:22:51.930
True harmony.

00:22:58.840 --> 00:23:00.670
Yun Gyonok from the Phapyeong family of Yun.

00:23:01.440 --> 00:23:03.210
Min Jayon from the Yohyn clan of Min.

00:23:03.940 --> 00:23:06.010
Khon Simkhyan from the Namyang family of Khon.

00:23:06.750 --> 00:23:10.180
I appoint you as second-rank concubines.

00:23:13.820 --> 00:23:18.090
These three concubines, along with their families, join the royal family.

00:23:18.660 --> 00:23:21.330
Pass it on to your families

00:23:21.330 --> 00:23:23.930
