00:23:24.400 --> 00:23:27.500
-Thank you, Your Majesty.
-Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:23:32.740 --> 00:23:34.270
Well, finally.

00:23:35.070 --> 00:23:37.740
The king began to gather allies around himself.

00:23:38.280 --> 00:23:40.450
But they will break all ties with him,

00:23:40.450 --> 00:23:42.620
as soon as they find out how weak he is.

00:23:44.680 --> 00:23:48.620
The king insisted on holding a feast.

00:23:48.890 --> 00:23:50.160
Is this what he wanted?

00:23:51.420 --> 00:23:54.330
-I hope you are getting ready.
-Don't worry.

00:24:04.200 --> 00:24:05.240
More!

