00:29:00.410 --> 00:29:02.640
Do they write novels for me there?

00:29:06.950 --> 00:29:09.380
Well, let's see.

00:29:11.290 --> 00:29:14.390
What beautiful handwriting.
This is what it means to come from a good family.

00:29:17.030 --> 00:29:19.660
On a sleepless night I walk.

00:29:20.930 --> 00:29:24.070
Light breaks through the dark night sky.

00:29:25.030 --> 00:29:28.740
I raise my head - maybe it's the moon?
No, this is my dear friend.

00:29:30.740 --> 00:29:32.910
Spanish shame.
But it touches the soul.

00:29:33.640 --> 00:29:35.640
Then we must also...

00:30:00.540 --> 00:30:02.300
-Hon Young.
-Yes, Your Majesty.

00:30:03.540 --> 00:30:05.870
This is the answer. Deliver it to the sender of that letter.

00:30:06.480 --> 00:30:09.110
I think about many things.

00:30:09.110 --> 00:30:11.210
With a happy heart I drown in thoughts of you.

00:30:11.210 --> 00:30:13.920
Please, row to me.

00:30:14.520 --> 00:30:18.990
I didn’t let go of thoughts about you.

00:30:21.860 --> 00:30:22.960
My queen.

00:30:28.230 --> 00:30:30.470
So the knowledge from the entrance exams came in handy.

00:30:30.930 --> 00:30:34.000
Great, this is how I get my masculinity back.

00:30:36.140 --> 00:30:37.210
OK.

00:31:25.950 --> 00:31:27.390
Follow the same recipe

00:31:27.890 --> 00:31:29.730
