00:31:50.650 --> 00:31:53.020
It is very important for me now to find myself again.

00:31:53.020 --> 00:31:54.120
Please don't interfere.

00:31:54.620 --> 00:31:55.620
Rude.

00:31:55.620 --> 00:31:56.650
What is it?

00:31:58.490 --> 00:32:00.220
How can she transform like that?

00:32:02.620 --> 00:32:04.730
The Queen is shyer than she seems.

00:32:09.900 --> 00:32:11.800
The list of dishes for the ceremony is ready.

00:32:12.670 --> 00:32:13.770
Nice job.

00:32:15.770 --> 00:32:18.570
Have you checked the list of offerings for the ceremony?

00:32:18.940 --> 00:32:20.480
Here's the list.

00:32:20.480 --> 00:32:22.410
Why do they all say boner?

00:32:23.710 --> 00:32:26.950
The list of dishes is the menu.

00:32:27.180 --> 00:32:30.290
The offering list is a list of things for the ritual.

00:32:30.850 --> 00:32:32.150
What's the matter with you, Your Majesty?

00:32:32.250 --> 00:32:34.390
Is it true? So am I a deaf pervert?

00:32:37.560 --> 00:32:39.290
Your Majesty!

00:32:43.300 --> 00:32:45.270
You work so much.

00:32:45.270 --> 00:32:47.870
Go and rest, Your Majesty.

00:32:48.640 --> 00:32:49.770
No.

00:32:50.710 --> 00:32:52.270
There is no time. Let's continue.

00:32:54.480 --> 00:32:55.740
I almost felt sorry for him.

00:32:56.810 --> 00:32:58.910
Not the point. Today I will write a letter more angrily.

00:32:59.550 --> 00:33:01.020
Boner is a dangerous word according to Freud.

00:33:01.020 --> 00:33:03.150
His nosebleed was clearly not from work.

00:33:07.320 --> 00:33:09.960
I will die with your name on my lips!

00:33:10.290 --> 00:33:13.330
It will remain in my memory - do not forget it.

00:33:15.000 --> 00:33:17.070
How can she be one at night and another during the day?

00:33:17.730 --> 00:33:20.340
Can't decide whether to forgive me

00:33:20.340 --> 00:33:21.900
or not?

00:33:30.650 --> 00:33:33.150
I have no forgiveness for my broken heart.

00:33:33.850 --> 00:33:36.320
Is there a road we can walk together?

00:33:44.630 --> 00:33:48.200
I hope next time we
Let's follow it from the very beginning.

00:33:48.630 --> 00:33:51.200
Even in dreams.

00:34:06.480 --> 00:34:08.220
Do you practice with your sword at night?

00:34:08.450 --> 00:34:10.320
One abnormal person is enough for us.

00:34:10.320 --> 00:34:12.650
We need to prepare for battle for the holiday.

00:34:13.120 --> 00:34:14.960
Well then, train with someone from Syskny.

00:34:17.490 --> 00:34:20.600
How do you rate your sword skills?

00:34:20.800 --> 00:34:21.960
I don't know.

00:34:22.100 --> 00:34:24.270
