00:34:25.800 --> 00:34:27.500
That's why I need you.

00:34:28.340 --> 00:34:30.170
An enemy whose strength is unknown to me.

00:35:04.340 --> 00:35:07.340
cart day

00:35:07.440 --> 00:35:08.940
Long life and good luck

00:35:29.830 --> 00:35:31.530
The weather is fine, Your Majesty.

00:35:31.530 --> 00:35:32.970
Is it true? This is good.

00:35:32.970 --> 00:35:35.430
I hate it when it rains on sports matchdays.

00:35:38.240 --> 00:35:41.110
My father will come. Therefore, you need to be even more chic.

00:35:41.280 --> 00:35:44.050
This is the first day that I will appear in front of everyone.

00:35:44.050 --> 00:35:45.480
Pay more attention.

00:35:49.220 --> 00:35:50.920
Yes. I'm beautiful.

00:35:52.020 --> 00:35:53.420
Everyone will stare at me, right?

00:36:06.270 --> 00:36:09.240
Are you going to use
metal tips?

00:36:10.410 --> 00:36:11.540
Today I need

00:36:15.480 --> 00:36:16.880
