00:36:20.250 --> 00:36:22.250
Okay, we need to deliver this quickly.

00:36:22.250 --> 00:36:23.650
Move over.

00:36:26.020 --> 00:36:27.420
Hello sir.

00:36:27.620 --> 00:36:31.090
We have fresh products
to a banquet in honor of Cart Day

00:36:31.090 --> 00:36:32.960
and royal offerings.

00:36:33.130 --> 00:36:36.030
We need to hurry to the palace. Sorry.

00:36:36.530 --> 00:36:38.900
-Do you have documents for them?
-Certainly.

00:36:39.730 --> 00:36:40.840
Here.

00:37:17.010 --> 00:37:18.810
It's time to change clothes, Your Majesty.

00:37:19.710 --> 00:37:20.710
Wait a little.

00:37:22.140 --> 00:37:24.050
Today is a very important day.

00:37:24.780 --> 00:37:28.420
You should at least try
predict fate here.

00:37:30.890 --> 00:37:35.090
Well, let's see. Map for the Cho clan.

00:37:44.970 --> 00:37:46.200
Thujong is the lowest card in the Thujong game.

00:37:46.200 --> 00:37:47.600
Bunny card.

00:37:53.340 --> 00:37:57.010
Well, luck is a relative thing.

00:37:58.310 --> 00:38:02.580
Come on. A card for our king.

00:38:09.360 --> 00:38:10.430
What?

00:38:17.370 --> 00:38:19.930
"Injeong." Ninth card.

00:38:20.440 --> 00:38:21.740
Will everything turn the other way around?

00:38:26.070 --> 00:38:27.710
