00:39:08.320 --> 00:39:11.050
You don’t even hide your dislike for me.

00:39:11.520 --> 00:39:14.090
In my being a queen
such behavior was unheard of.

00:39:14.520 --> 00:39:15.660
Regardless of the era

00:39:15.660 --> 00:39:18.630
