to be taken by surprise by your mother-in-law.

00:39:18.630 --> 00:39:20.930
Well, look at her, she snaps at me.

00:39:23.060 --> 00:39:27.140
I heard you cook for the Queen Dowager.

00:39:27.740 --> 00:39:31.540
And she never even offered me a snack.

00:39:32.240 --> 00:39:33.510
You must be afraid

00:39:33.510 --> 00:39:36.410
my husband's grandmother more than me.

00:39:37.110 --> 00:39:39.180
What are you saying, that's not true.

00:39:39.180 --> 00:39:42.420
The Dowager Queen is very good
takes care of himself,

00:39:42.420 --> 00:39:43.720
so he looks young.

00:39:44.190 --> 00:39:46.390
Yes, time cannot be fooled.

00:39:47.790 --> 00:39:49.460
You need to think carefully.

00:39:49.890 --> 00:39:52.990
I will live longer than the Queen Dowager.

00:39:56.660 --> 00:39:58.470
I will serve you my food someday.

00:39:58.470 --> 00:40:00.070
I have to try it now.

00:40:00.900 --> 00:40:04.870
I'm very curious about your cooking,
which I only heard about.

00:40:04.870 --> 00:40:07.040
I have no strength to wait.

00:40:08.240 --> 00:40:10.810
Right now?

00:40:11.710 --> 00:40:14.650
