-We won't be able to serve anything.

00:42:29.380 --> 00:42:32.090
Don't worry. Do it with yours
sides whatever you can.

00:42:32.850 --> 00:42:36.520
I'll do my best
to get those products.

00:42:38.990 --> 00:42:40.030
Yes.

00:42:49.240 --> 00:42:51.470
God, what are you doing?

00:42:52.510 --> 00:42:55.210
Royal Chef! Hey!

00:42:55.480 --> 00:42:58.980
I need to show her how I carry food myself.

00:42:59.410 --> 00:43:01.550
This will make her feel better, right?

00:43:10.220 --> 00:43:12.460
The combination of sweet syrup and salt makes it

00:43:12.460 --> 00:43:13.830
the perfect sweet and salty dish.

00:43:24.640 --> 00:43:32.510
There I see a beautiful mountain...

00:43:44.530 --> 00:43:45.730
Director Han?

00:43:47.500 --> 00:43:48.500
You bastard!

00:43:49.500 --> 00:43:50.500
