00:47:12.000 --> 00:47:13.200
Of course not.

00:47:13.700 --> 00:47:17.410
If someone has committed a crime,
he must be punished accordingly.

00:47:17.570 --> 00:47:19.740
Glad you're aware.

00:47:21.180 --> 00:47:23.710
The Queen sent me some snacks this morning,

00:47:23.710 --> 00:47:26.580
