00:53:46.160 --> 00:53:50.200
bear - 9 and tiger - 10 points.

00:53:50.200 --> 00:53:51.230
Wolf, tiger, rabbit, deer.

00:53:51.230 --> 00:53:52.970
Each will be given 10 arrows.

00:53:53.430 --> 00:53:56.370
For the sake of a fair fight, your ladies of the court and maids

00:53:56.370 --> 00:53:57.670
will not participate.

00:53:58.610 --> 00:54:00.210
That's tough.

00:54:00.640 --> 00:54:02.040
Nowadays this would make people

00:54:02.040 --> 00:54:03.480
sign the national petition.

00:54:03.910 --> 00:54:06.650
Then it's time to start.

00:54:17.060 --> 00:54:19.460
You can leave now.

00:54:26.170 --> 00:54:28.900
We just need to kill time here and come back.

00:54:46.090 --> 00:54:49.290
Shooting matches today are so predictable.

00:54:50.260 --> 00:54:52.590
This is a battle for the honor of the family,

00:54:53.060 --> 00:54:55.800
but the queen doesn't seem interested.

00:54:56.030 --> 00:54:59.630
I didn't know you had time to worry about a joke fight.

00:55:00.070 --> 00:55:03.140
You may well see your son today.

00:55:08.580 --> 00:55:10.940
The time has come to present my gift.

00:55:12.350 --> 00:55:14.580
The night the queen fell into a vegetative state,

00:55:14.580 --> 00:55:17.550
the royal concubine and the king were about to share a bed.

00:55:17.950 --> 00:55:19.950
The queen woke up

00:55:19.950 --> 00:55:22.660
just a day after that.

00:55:25.290 --> 00:55:26.660
Are you saying she was faking it?

00:55:26.660 --> 00:55:29.660
to stop them?

00:55:31.230 --> 00:55:33.970
The queen put it all on the line

00:55:33.970 --> 00:55:35.670
to win the king's heart.

00:55:36.240 --> 00:55:37.870
She threw herself into the lake,

00:55:37.870 --> 00:55:40.240
She protected the royal concubine from the sword.

00:55:40.970 --> 00:55:43.810
She sacrificed the last thing she had left.

00:55:47.050 --> 00:55:49.880
The queen rejected her family.

00:55:59.160 --> 00:56:02.630
I was bored and you amused me.

00:56:03.430 --> 00:56:07.430
The king, for no apparent reason, threw a feast.

00:56:07.870 --> 00:56:10.040
And the queen rushed to take away the concubines

00:56:10.040 --> 00:56:12.540
from the most influential families.

00:56:12.710 --> 00:56:15.840
She chose those who can support the king.

00:56:16.640 --> 00:56:19.780
Today the king will reveal his true face,

00:56:19.780 --> 00:56:22.280
which is still hidden from officials.

00:56:22.620 --> 00:56:25.090
The face of a strong ruler.

00:56:28.560 --> 00:56:30.490
Do you understand now?

00:56:31.160 --> 00:56:33.860
The queen is at one with the king.

00:56:33.860 --> 00:56:37.500
Aren't you afraid for your life when you say this?

00:56:37.860 --> 00:56:41.030
And you probably believed that the queen would never betray you.

00:56:42.300 --> 00:56:44.500
I'm very disappointed.

00:56:44.910 --> 00:56:47.210
Fall for her cheap tricks

00:56:47.210 --> 00:56:48.840
and let themselves be fooled.

00:56:49.480 --> 00:56:52.210
Looks like they've grown quite old.

00:56:53.980 --> 00:56:56.380
I will tear out these vile lips.

00:56:56.380 --> 00:56:59.650
The queen pretended to faint, there is no sin on me.

00:56:59.650 --> 00:57:03.460
And I have nothing to fear anymore!

00:57:08.460 --> 00:57:10.460
Why did you stop playing?

00:57:10.760 --> 00:57:13.830
You're upsetting the Queen Dowager.

00:57:27.750 --> 00:57:29.150
And now

00:57:29.150 --> 00:57:33.450
the king will give you fans.

00:57:55.380 --> 00:57:58.610
You did a great job. I'm looking forward to the feast.

00:57:59.680 --> 00:58:02.350
You did a great job too.

00:58:08.620 --> 00:58:11.260
The Dowager Queen has arrived.

00:58:16.100 --> 00:58:17.200
You are here.

00:58:21.200 --> 00:58:23.470
It was so boring there.

00:58:23.470 --> 00:58:24.870
I couldn't stand it.

00:58:26.870 --> 00:58:29.510
I wonder if things will get better here.

00:58:30.210 --> 00:58:32.510
Sorry I couldn't please you.

00:58:34.550 --> 00:58:37.250
I wanted to see martial arts, but I was too late.

00:58:39.750 --> 00:58:43.590
Although watching performances is also boring.

00:58:45.930 --> 00:58:49.100
I would prefer real fights.

00:58:50.530 --> 00:58:52.630
I will order the royal guard to compete among themselves.

00:58:53.530 --> 00:58:55.240
How about performing yourself?

00:58:59.440 --> 00:59:01.580
I heard you chopped wood in Ganghwado

00:59:01.580 --> 00:59:04.310
and carried the water himself.

00:59:05.180 --> 00:59:08.050
With such and such a powerhouse it won’t be difficult.

00:59:11.120 --> 00:59:13.790
Manual labor and martial arts are very different.

00:59:14.390 --> 00:59:17.490
And in recent years I have been sitting more and more on the throne.

00:59:17.490 --> 00:59:18.890
The body became completely wooden.

00:59:18.890 --> 00:59:21.260
Well, use a fan instead of a weapon.

00:59:24.800 --> 00:59:27.700
How about a competition with the head of the Detective Department?

00:59:27.700 --> 00:59:29.200
You are about the same age.

00:59:32.410 --> 00:59:33.640
Head of the Detective Department -

00:59:33.640 --> 00:59:35.910
a professional warrior who has trained for years.

00:59:36.880 --> 00:59:38.950
I'm afraid the king might get hurt.

00:59:38.950 --> 00:59:40.350
If you want to see the fight, I'll invite...

00:59:40.350 --> 00:59:43.220
I want to see the king fight.

00:59:48.920 --> 00:59:50.260
What do you say?

00:59:53.390 --> 00:59:55.400
Father was wrong.

00:59:57.030 --> 01:00:00.930
Please see his true colors at Cart Day.

01:00:11.810 --> 01:00:13.210
Deer.

01:00:21.420 --> 01:00:22.460
How so?

01:00:23.620 --> 01:00:24.660
Bear.

01:00:54.020 --> 01:00:55.160
Go.

01:00:55.160 --> 01:00:57.320
You're not the prey I'm looking for.

01:01:10.970 --> 01:01:12.110
Did you go the wrong way?

01:01:16.080 --> 01:01:17.640
I think I've already seen this tree.

01:01:19.750 --> 01:01:21.680
And where should I go?

01:01:25.820 --> 01:01:27.520
We will have fans in our hands.

01:01:27.890 --> 01:01:30.720
The one who takes the fan from the opponent will win.

01:01:34.190 --> 01:01:35.530
Take it easy.

01:02:04.190 --> 01:02:06.360
What's happening?

01:02:08.190 --> 01:02:10.060
He said, take it easy.

01:02:11.160 --> 01:02:13.730
How will you respond if you wound the king?

01:02:15.700 --> 01:02:18.310
This is the Queen Dowager's order.

01:02:18.310 --> 01:02:20.070
There is nothing left to do but fulfill it.

01:02:25.110 --> 01:02:28.110
So the Queen Dowager stands behind you.

01:02:32.690 --> 01:02:35.220
So I have to teach you a lesson.

01:02:35.220 --> 01:02:37.320
I'll show you who's boss in the palace.

01:03:00.780 --> 01:03:02.420
You said he's different from the late king.

01:03:02.980 --> 01:03:04.580
And the truth is different.

01:03:08.790 --> 01:03:10.420
Oh well.

01:03:10.420 --> 01:03:13.130
I need to take a nap. They will find me when it's all over.

01:03:16.260 --> 01:03:17.360
Damn, I scared you!

01:03:19.070 --> 01:03:20.230
What are you doing here?

01:03:22.040 --> 01:03:25.140
What do you think? I'm hiding to survive.

01:03:25.710 --> 01:03:28.170
Well, you won't really die. Why are you so afraid?

01:03:28.410 --> 01:03:32.310
I know, but the arrows still hurt.

01:03:32.910 --> 01:03:34.950
I still have bruises from last year.

01:03:34.950 --> 01:03:36.120
What a whiner.

01:03:37.780 --> 01:03:39.850
Don't be afraid, hunting doesn't tempt me.

01:03:40.450 --> 01:03:43.860
Well, others will hit me.

01:03:55.500 --> 01:03:56.870
There you go.

01:03:57.200 --> 01:03:59.310
How did you manage to come back like that?

01:04:00.440 --> 01:04:01.470
Tiger.

01:04:06.880 --> 01:04:07.950
So?

01:04:08.880 --> 01:04:11.620
Thank you, Your Majesty.

01:04:11.620 --> 01:04:12.890
Keep a souvenir.

01:04:14.120 --> 01:04:15.220
Go.

01:04:17.190 --> 01:04:18.960
Already?

01:04:20.830 --> 01:04:22.600
Didn't know the queen was so good at shooting

01:04:22.600 --> 01:04:25.300
to hit the tiger so quickly.

01:04:25.300 --> 01:04:27.570
Yes, she is a born archer.

01:04:27.570 --> 01:04:30.870
I didn’t even see her, only the wind whistled in my ears.

01:04:30.870 --> 01:04:33.470
So they shot me.

01:04:33.470 --> 01:04:34.570
Is it true?

01:06:13.110 --> 01:06:14.210
So it was you.

01:06:14.970 --> 01:06:16.910
You were that person.

01:06:20.210 --> 01:06:22.050
I won't forgive you.

01:06:42.000 --> 01:06:44.970
I'll kill you.

01:07:05.530 --> 01:07:10.000
How I became queen

01:07:25.410 --> 01:07:27.680
I have sad news.

01:07:27.680 --> 01:07:29.050
My hand trembled

01:07:29.050 --> 01:07:30.980
and I made it into a queen.

01:07:30.980 --> 01:07:33.250
The feast is about to begin, but the ingredients have not arrived.

01:07:33.250 --> 01:07:34.320
This is all?

01:07:34.320 --> 01:07:35.890
Did you add the poison?

01:07:36.060 --> 01:07:37.560
Name - Lee Senman.

01:07:37.890 --> 01:07:39.760
I'll create a new menu using the ingredients I have.

01:07:39.760 --> 01:07:41.930
How dare you fry my precious needle.

01:07:41.930 --> 01:07:44.400
What we are going to cook today is not a simple meal.

01:07:44.400 --> 01:07:45.670
She deserves a president.

01:07:45.930 --> 01:07:47.970
How dare you disobey the orders of your lord?

01:07:47.970 --> 01:07:50.400
-Grab them!
-This is not betrayal, but rebellion!

01:07:50.400 --> 01:07:53.670
You will have to pay for the ability to control your temper.
